#: ../../05_node-guide/15_join-testnet.md:36
msgid "The exact image digest the Testnet runs is recorded in `node-config/testnet/vps-image.env` in the infra repository. Use that digest instead of `testnet-latest` if you want to run byte-for-byte the same build."
